@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 1. GET semua order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### 2. GET satu order berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1

### 3. POST buat order baru (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Rian Hidayat",
  "menuName": "Shoyu Ramen",
  "quantity": 2,
  "totalPrice": 30000,
  "isTakeaway": false,
  "status": "pending",
  "orderDate": "2026-11-21T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 4. PATCH ubah status / data order (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "cooking"
}

### 5. DELETE hapus order (200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/4

### --- SKENARIO ERROR (Untuk Screenshot Validasi & Exception) ---

### 6. Error 400 Bad Request - Validasi DTO gagal
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "A",
  "menuName": "",
  "quantity": 0,
  "totalPrice": -5000,
  "isTakeaway": "bukan-boolean",
  "status": "ngasal",
  "orderDate": "bukan-tanggal"
}

### 7. Error 409 ConflictException - Pelanggan & menu sama masih pending
# Jalankan request #3 dulu (status pending), lalu jalankan ini:
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Mas Agus",
  "menuName": "Tantan Ramen",
  "quantity": 1,
  "totalPrice": 15000,
  "isTakeaway": false,
  "status": "pending"
}

### 8. Error 404 NotFoundException - ID tidak ditemukan
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/999
